{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Saya akan lihat referensinya, lalu siapkan blok navigasi kembali ke jurnal dan tombol berbagi artikel dengan gaya yang sama.
    
    Prompt sudah disiapkan: “« BACK TO JOURNAL” di kiri dan “SHARE: COPY LINK | WHATSAPP” di kanan, dengan border tipis dan font retro seperti gambar. Belum ada perubahan pada tema; klik tautan ini untuk membuat bloknya.
    
    Berikut prompt lengkapnya:
    
        Buat blok navigasi dan share artikel untuk template artikel blog, mengikuti gambar referensi.
    
        TAMPILAN
        - Satu bar horizontal minimalis dengan latar putih.
        - Border tipis abu-abu, sudut persegi, tanpa shadow.
        - Teks kecil uppercase berwarna navy menggunakan font retro pixel/monospace.
        - Padding awal sekitar 16px horizontal dan 18px vertikal.
        - Desktop: link “« BACK TO JOURNAL” di kiri.
        - Di kanan tampilkan “SHARE: COPY LINK | WHATSAPP”.
        - Kedua sisi berjauhan dan rata tengah secara vertikal.
    
        NAVIGASI KEMBALI
        - Gunakan blog.url dari konteks artikel aktif.
        - Jangan hardcode /blogs/journal.
        - Label kembali dapat diedit di Theme Editor.
    
        COPY LINK
        - Gunakan elemen button yang tampil seperti link teks.
        - Salin URL kanonis absolut artikel aktif, bukan URL Theme Editor atau URL preview dengan parameter.
        - Gunakan Clipboard API dengan fallback yang aman.
        - Tampilkan “LINK COPIED” hanya setelah penyalinan berhasil.
        - Jika gagal, tampilkan pesan kegagalan.
        - Gunakan aria-live untuk feedback tanpa menggeser layout.
    
        WHATSAPP
        - Buka https://wa.me/?text= dengan pesan berisi judul artikel aktif dan URL kanonis absolutnya.
        - Encode pesan dengan benar.
        - Buka di tab baru dengan rel="noopener noreferrer".
    
        PENGATURAN THEME EDITOR
        Sediakan pengaturan yang terhubung ke tampilan untuk:
        - Warna latar, teks, dan border.
        - Ketebalan border.
        - Font dan ukuran font desktop/mobile.
        - Padding vertikal dan horizontal.
        - Lebar maksimum kontainer.
        - Label kembali, SHARE, COPY LINK, dan WHATSAPP.
        - Pesan penyalinan berhasil dan gagal.
        - Toggle tampilkan COPY LINK.
        - Toggle tampilkan WHATSAPP.
    
        RESPONSIVE DAN AKSESIBILITAS
        - Mobile: izinkan wrap rapi atau susun link kembali di atas dan share di bawah.
        - Tidak boleh ada overflow atau teks bertumpuk.
        - Gunakan struktur nav, link, dan button yang sesuai.
        - Sediakan fokus keyboard yang terlihat dan area klik yang cukup besar.
        - Script dibatasi pada instance blok.
        - Pastikan tetap bekerja setelah blok dimuat ulang di Theme Editor tanpa listener duplikat.
    
        BATASAN
        - Jangan tambahkan ikon media sosial.
        - Jangan tambahkan previous/next post.
        - Jangan tambahkan judul artikel, isi artikel, panel promosi, atau checklist.
        - Gunakan konteks artikel dan blog aktif secara dinamis.
        - Jangan buat konten contoh atau tautan palsu.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% assign canonical_article_url = request.origin | append: article.url %}

{% style %}
  .ai-journal-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: {{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;
    max-width: {{ block.settings.max_width }}px;
    margin-inline: auto;
    background: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    border: {{ block.settings.border_width }}px solid {{ block.settings.border_color }};
    box-sizing: border-box;
    font-family: ChiKareGo2;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.font_size_desktop }}px;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }
  .ai-journal-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: {{ block.settings.padding_vertical }}px {{ block.settings.padding_horizontal }}px;
  }
  .ai-journal-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}__back,
  .ai-journal-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}__share,
  .ai-journal-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}__action {
    color: inherit;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  .ai-journal-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}__back { text-decoration: none; padding: 8px 0; }
  .ai-journal-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}__share { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-end; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; text-align: right; }
  .ai-journal-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}__actions { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
  .ai-journal-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}__action {
    appearance: none;
    border: 0;
    background: transparent;
    font: inherit;
    cursor: pointer;
    padding: 8px 2px;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
  .ai-journal-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}__action:hover,
  .ai-journal-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}__back:hover { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .ai-journal-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}__back:focus-visible,
  .ai-journal-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}__action:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid currentColor; outline-offset: 3px; }
  .ai-journal-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}__feedback { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0; }
  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-journal-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }} { font-size: {{ block.settings.font_size_mobile }}px; }
    .ai-journal-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; gap: 4px; }
    .ai-journal-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}__share { justify-content: flex-start; text-align: left; }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<journal-share-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-journal-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-copy-success="{{ block.settings.copy_success | escape }}" data-copy-failure="{{ block.settings.copy_failure | escape }}" data-copy-label="{{ block.settings.copy_label | escape }}" data-article-url="{{ canonical_article_url | escape }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  {% if article and blog %}
    <nav class="ai-journal-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner" aria-label="Article navigation and sharing">
      <a class="ai-journal-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}__back" href="{{ blog.url }}">{{ block.settings.back_label | escape }}</a>
      <div class="ai-journal-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}__share">
        <span>{{ block.settings.share_label | escape }}:</span>
        <span class="ai-journal-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}__actions">
          {% if block.settings.show_copy %}
            <button class="ai-journal-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}__action" type="button" data-copy>{{ block.settings.copy_label | escape }}</button>
          {% endif %}
          {% if block.settings.show_copy and block.settings.show_whatsapp %}<span aria-hidden="true">|</span>{% endif %}
          {% if block.settings.show_whatsapp %}
            {% assign share_text = article.title | append: ' ' | append: canonical_article_url %}
            <a class="ai-journal-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}__action" href="https://wa.me/?text={{ share_text | url_encode }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ block.settings.whatsapp_label | escape }}</a>
          {% endif %}
        </span>
        <span class="ai-journal-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}__feedback" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true" data-feedback></span>
      </div>
    </nav>
  {% endif %}
</journal-share-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (() => {
    const tagName = 'journal-share-{{ ai_gen_id }}';
    if (customElements.get(tagName)) return;
    class JournalShare extends HTMLElement {
      connectedCallback() {
        if (this._onClick) this.removeEventListener('click', this._onClick);
        this._onClick = async (event) => {
          const button = event.target.closest('[data-copy]');
          if (!button || !this.contains(button)) return;
          const feedback = this.querySelector('[data-feedback]');
          const text = this.dataset.copySuccess;
          const url = this.dataset.articleUrl;
          let copied = false;
          try {
            if (navigator.clipboard && window.isSecureContext) {
              await navigator.clipboard.writeText(url);
              copied = true;
            } else {
              const field = document.createElement('textarea');
              field.value = url;
              field.setAttribute('readonly', '');
              field.style.position = 'fixed';
              field.style.opacity = '0';
              this.appendChild(field);
              field.select();
              copied = document.execCommand('copy');
              field.remove();
            }
          } catch (error) {
            copied = false;
          }
          feedback.textContent = copied ? text : this.dataset.copyFailure;
        };
        this.addEventListener('click', this._onClick);
      }
      disconnectedCallback() {
        if (this._onClick) this.removeEventListener('click', this._onClick);
      }
    }
    customElements.define(tagName, JournalShare);
  })();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Journal nav and share",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "header", "content": "Labels" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "back_label", "label": "Back label", "default": "« Back to journal" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "share_label", "label": "Share label", "default": "Share" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "copy_label", "label": "Copy link label", "default": "Copy link" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "whatsapp_label", "label": "WhatsApp label", "default": "WhatsApp" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "copy_success", "label": "Copy success message", "default": "Link copied" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "copy_failure", "label": "Copy failure message", "default": "Could not copy link" },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_copy", "label": "Show copy link", "default": true },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_whatsapp", "label": "Show WhatsApp", "default": true },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Appearance" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "background_color", "label": "Background", "default": "#FFFFFF" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "text_color", "label": "Text", "default": "#06149B" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "border_color", "label": "Border", "default": "#8588B0" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "border_width", "label": "Border thickness", "min": 0, "max": 4, "step": 1, "unit": "px", "default": 1 },
    { "type": "font_picker", "id": "font_family", "label": "Font", "default": "anonymous_pro_n4" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "font_size_desktop", "label": "Desktop font size", "min": 10, "max": 20, "step": 1, "unit": "px", "default": 12 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "font_size_mobile", "label": "Mobile font size", "min": 10, "max": 18, "step": 1, "unit": "px", "default": 12 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "padding_vertical", "label": "Vertical padding", "min": 8, "max": 40, "step": 2, "unit": "px", "default": 18 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "padding_horizontal", "label": "Horizontal padding", "min": 8, "max": 40, "step": 2, "unit": "px", "default": 16 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "max_width", "label": "Maximum width", "min": 400, "max": 1600, "step": 100, "unit": "px", "default": 1200 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "desktop_width_percent", "label": "Desktop width", "min": 50, "max": 100, "step": 5, "unit": "%", "default": 100 }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Journal nav and share" }],
  "tag": null,
  "class": "journal-nav-share-block"
}
{% endschema %}